<title>CHINA: Shanghai Jinjiang first-half net down.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Jinjiang first-half net down.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996 (in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	     122.218	  vs   121.818</p>
<p> Net profit	    27.082	  vs    30.039</p>
<p> Earnings per share    0.078 yuan  vs     0.095</p>
<p> Net assets per share  4.11  yuan  vs     4.39</p>
<p>Note: the figures are unaudited. Shanghai Jinjiang Tower Co Ltd operates a five-star Shanghai hotel.</p>
</text>
